ToolTrap
========

ToolTrap builds on the SafeLabs Eval framework (Apache-2.0,
Copyright AgentSafeLabs) and extends it with the MCPBench suite.

The foundation library — the 300-prompt ASI red-teaming corpus, the
runner, the scoring detectors, and the framework adapters — originates
from SafeLabs Eval, Copyright AgentSafeLabs, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license text is in the LICENSE
file at the root of this distribution, and it applies to the whole
tree, including the new MCPBench package.

MCPBench — the rogue MCP server fixture, the 30 MCP01–MCP05 scenarios,
the tool-call transcript harness, and the transcript detectors — is
the new work shipped in ToolTrap 1.0.0, released under the same
Apache License, Version 2.0.

No copyright notices from the original work have been removed or
altered. See CREDITS.md for the foundation framework's own contributor
acknowledgements.
